<title>USA: Typhoon moving west of Mariana Islands.</title>
<headline>Typhoon moving west of Mariana Islands.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Typhoon Isa, with 130 mph winds, is southwest of the Mariana Islands moving west northwest, private forecaster Weather Services Corporation said.</p>
<p>Isa is a major threat to shipping but no longer threatens the islands.</p>
<p>It is expected to weaken slowly and curve more to the north then northeast during the next few days.</p>
